              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Most customers are concentrated in California and Oregon, while other states have a smaller presence. In terms of gender, the distribution is fairly balanced, with a slight majority of women. &#10;&#10;Also, most customers are employed, and this group clearly outnumbers others, such as retirees.' captured-sheet='DashLab1' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='Customers are mainly concentrated in California, followed by Oregon and Arizona. The relationship between income and customer lifetime value is not very clear, as the data points are widely dispersed. Additionally, claim amounts vary by vehicle size, with a fairly similar distribution across categories but some higher values present in all groups.' captured-sheet='Dashboard 3' id='2' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
